    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are pleased to introduce No. 44 The Rise, Kingswood to the market. Situated in the ever-popular Kingswood estate, this two-bedroom bungalow offers an excellent opportunity for those looking to create a home to their own taste. While the property requires complete refurbishment, it offers good potential for those seeking a manageable project, with the added benefit of scope to extend to the rear, subject to planning permission. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, living room to the front, two bedrooms, shower room and kitchen to the rear. The paved rear garden enjoys the benefit of side access, while the front garden provides off-street parking, together with a courtyard area. \n\nNo. 44 enjoys a mature and well-established setting within Kingswood, with a host of local amenities close by. There is easy access to the M50, N7, N81 and Belgard Road, while the LUAS Red Line is just a few minutes' walk away. The area is also well served by the 65 bus route to Dublin City Centre. A selection of local schools, shops and other amenities are within walking distance, making this a convenient location with excellent transport links."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 2-bedroom bungalow</li><li> Approx. 49 sq.m of living space</li><li> Large rear garden with side access, offering excellent potential to extend (subject to p.p.)</li><li> Off street parking to the front</li><li> Electric storage heating</li><li> Close to Luas, M50 and local amenities including TU Tallaght and Tallaght University Hospital</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E\nBER No: 119603462\n"
      },
      {
